The statements made in this Management Discussion and Analysis were of the best judgment of management but the ultimate results may differ from estimates which is due to several factors like Government Policies, Economic Conditions in the Country, Demand and Supply changes, Changes in Management Policies etc which could lead to difference between the projections and actual results.

