Capital Outturn

Capital expenditure is not shown in the Comprehensive Income and Expenditure Statement but is budgeted for and reported separately. The capital programme for 2019/20 was £1.211m which together with a number of carry-forward schemes and in year funding totalled £9.535m. The table below shows the final capital position at year-end for each service area.

| Portfolio                                      | Budget 2019/20 £000 | Actuals £000 | Slippage £000 | Year End Variance £000 |
