limited to “key market participants.”\textsuperscript{31} As such, the Working Group respectfully requests for the CSA to continue this line of reasoning and limit any proposed internal reporting obligation to registered derivatives firms.

\section*{III. CONCLUSION}

The Working Group appreciates this opportunity to provide input on the Proposed Instrument and respectfully requests that the comments set forth herein are considered.

If you have any questions, please contact the undersigned.

