ONE SERVICE OF WORSHIP AT 10:00 A.M.
COMMISSIONING OF EDUCATION LEADERSHIP AND BLESSING OF THE BACKPACKS
Join your Westminster family for Commotion Sunday on September 10! We will celebrate one service of worship at 10:00 a.m. which will include (1) a slide presentation looking back on the 2016-2017 program year, (2) commissioning of the 2017-2018 Education Leadership Team, and (3) the blessing of backpacks as our children and youth begin a new school year and the journey of learning and growing together.

A brunch reception in Parish Hall will follow worship and include ministry displays and children’s activities. Along with opportunities to sign up for Bible study, fellowship, mission and service, members will be able to add the Church Life app to their cell phones. This app includes the names and contact information of members.

