Identify resistances against insects and harness plants:

• Identified and characterized glycoalkaloid-based, trichome-based or novel mechanism resistances against insects
• Generated plant material with new resistances that can be further used
• Developed molecular markers that can be used to introgress resistance
• Understand the application of different resistance mechanisms

