People have used windmills for thousands of years to grind grain and pump water. Today we are learning to use the wind to make electric power. Windmill blades must be at an angle to the direction of the wind to work. The faster the wind blows, the faster your windmill will turn.

1. Make saw cut as shown.

2. Carefully carve away corner.

